<title>USA: Tunisia may seek 100,000 tonnes wheat soon - trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia may seek 100,000 tonnes wheat soon - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indications are that Tunisia will be seeking as early as next week about 100,000 tonnes of optional origin wheat for delivery in January and February, several U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>One exporter said the deal could include 50,000 tonnes of soft white wheat and 50,000 tonnes of hard wheat.</p>
<p>The tender could be early next week, another exporter said.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
